    <title>The Walt Disney Company | LinkedIn</title>
    <meta name="description" content="The Walt Disney Company | 6,392,066 followers on LinkedIn. The Walt Disney Company, together with its subsidiaries and affiliates, is a leading diversified international family entertainment and media enterprise that includes three core business segments: Disney Entertainment, ESPN, and Disney Experiences.

