    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company"},"datePublished":"2026-07-06T16:00:27.167Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_prep-for-your-next-interview-activity-7479927251958956032-7H76","text":"What helps candidates stand out in an interview? 💡 According to Disney recruiters, it starts with sharing meaningful examples, demonstrating how you approach challenges and showcasing the collaboration skills that drive success on high-performing teams: http://di.sn/6045BEBGIl\n\n#LifeAtDisney #DisneyCareers #CareerDevelopment #InterviewTips","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_prep-for-your-next-interview-activity-7479927251958956032-7H76"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company"},"datePublished":"2026-07-03T13:30:40.815Z","headline":"Disney Celebrates America","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_disney-celebrates-america-activity-7478802396865978368-MjPM","text":"America’s story has been shaped by those who believe in what’s possible — the builders, doers, trailblazers and service members who dedicate themselves to something greater. As we look ahead to America’s 250th anniversary, Disney is proud to honor the ideals that have inspired our nation and our company from the very beginning. #DisneyCelebratesAmerica","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_disney-celebrates-america-activity-7478802396865978368-MjPM"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company"},"datePublished":"2026-07-02T16:00:06.026Z","headline":"Meet Disney's Ad Platforms Technology Team","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_meet-disneys-ad-platforms-technology-team-activity-7478477611778793472-s4PI","text":"Meet the team behind the tech that powers advertising on Disney streaming platforms. ▶️ With scalable technology, innovative AI, global data and a dedication to teamwork, they're making incredible impacts in the advertising technology world. 🌎\n\nInterested? We're hiring technologists to join the team. Learn more and apply: http://di.sn/6040BDFMgi\n","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_meet-disneys-ad-platforms-technology-team-activity-7478477611778793472-s4PI"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company"},"datePublished":"2026-06-30T13:00:04.231Z","headline":"🎙️ How to Get a Job at Disney","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_how-to-get-a-job-at-disney-activity-7477707530048045057-rNsI","text":"Great careers are built one opportunity, one conversation and one application at a time. 🎙️ In the latest episode of the #LifeAtDisney podcast, Disney recruiters discuss what they look for in candidates and share their advice for navigating resumes, interviews and career growth: http://di.sn/6041BDxLkf\n\n👉From communicating impact to preparing experience examples that demonstrate problem-solving and collaboration, the episode provides a behind-the-scenes look at the hiring process and how candidates can put their careers into context.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_how-to-get-a-job-at-disney-activity-7477707530048045057-rNsI"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company"},"datePublished":"2026-06-29T16:00:03.913Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_lifeatdisney-activity-7477390439369707521-qTvd","text":"After connecting with the Asian American Journalists Association, journalism students Trisha and Navin scored summer internships with ESPN. ⭐️\n\n Read their story on the #LifeAtDisney blog: http://di.sn/6047BDQxXv","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_lifeatdisney-activity-7477390439369707521-qTvd"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company"},"datePublished":"2026-06-26T13:30:23.482Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_626day-lifeatdisney-disneycareers-activity-7476265609119444992-le9Q","text":"🌺 Time to make some mischief for #626Day! 🌺\n\n📸: Kaitlyn, Disney College Program\n📸: Onur, The Walt Disney Company Türkiye\n📸: Jane, The Walt Disney Company\n📸: Charmine, Disney Cruise Line\n📸: Emily, The Walt Disney Company\n📸: Liz, Disneyland Resort\n\n#LifeAtDisney #DisneyCareers","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_626day-lifeatdisney-disneycareers-activity-7476265609119444992-le9Q"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company"},"datePublished":"2026-06-24T17:34:22.434Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_halfway-to-the-holidays-with-disney-asia-activity-7475602233548652545--Ie2","text":"Ever wondered how a Disney retail campaign comes to life? Meet Jeab, a Marketing Manager with Disney Consumer Products who worked on the Disney The Magical Star campaign! 🎁✨\n\nExplore open roles across Disney Asia Pacific: http://di.sn/6043BDgXnz","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/the-walt-disney-company_halfway-to-the-holidays-with-disney-asia-activity-7475602233548652545--Ie2"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"The Walt Disney Company","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"The Walt Disney Company","addressLocality":"Burbank","addressRegion":"CA","postalCode":"91521","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"The Walt Disney Company, together with its subsidiaries and affiliates, is a leading diversified international family entertainment and media enterprise that includes three core business segments: Disney Entertainment, ESPN, and Disney Experiences.\n\nOur mission is to entertain, inform and inspire people around the globe through the power of unparalleled storytelling, reflecting the iconic brands, creative minds and innovative technologies that make us the world’s premier entertainment company.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":193656,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHScKuaJ_0-WA/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1712695425017/the_walt_disney_company_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=T9-V6R6_5hSaSjftJCchm8PF_rK_jnA-CxfOyemqgbc","description":"The Walt Disney Company","@type":"ImageObject"},"sameAs":"http://www.disneycareers.com"}]}
