    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Great careers are built one opportunity, one conversation and one application at a time. 🎙️ In the latest episode of the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flifeatdisney&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LifeAtDisney</a> podcast, Disney recruiters discuss what they look for in candidates and share their advice for navigating resumes, interviews and career growth: <a class="link" href="http://di.sn/6041BDxLkf?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>http://di.sn/6041BDxLkf</a>

👉From communicating impact to preparing experience examples that demonstrate problem-solving and collaboration, the episode provides a behind-the-scenes look at the hiring process and how candidates can put their careers into context.</p>
          
            
                  
    

